  "prayer_fragments": [
    {
      "unit": "birkhot_hatorah_laasoq",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "Blessed art Thou, O Lord our God, King of the World, who has sanctified us through His commandments and commanded us to occupy ourselves with the words of the Torah.",
      "reference_scan": "s45",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "adon_olam",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "Lord of the world, He who has reigned before any form was created.",
      "reference_scan": "s45",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "adon_olam",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "At the time when by His will everything came into being, then was His Name proclaimed as King.",
      "reference_scan": "s45",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "adon_olam",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "And after everything ceases to be then He alone inspiring awe will reign.",
      "reference_scan": "s45",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "adon_olam",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "He was, He is and He will be in glory.",
      "reference_scan": "s45",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "adon_olam",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "He is unique and there is no second to compare with Him or to associate with Him.",
      "reference_scan": "s45",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "adon_olam",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "Without beginning, without end, to Him might and dominion belong.",
      "reference_scan": "s45",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "adon_olam",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "He is my God and my Redeemer lives .",
      "reference_scan": "s45",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "adon_olam",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "The rock of my portion in time of distress.",
      "reference_scan": "s45",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "adon_olam",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "He is my banner and a refuge for me, the portion of my cup on the day I call.",
      "reference_scan": "s45",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "adon_olam",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "Into His hand I entrust my spirit at the time I sleep and I awake.",
      "reference_scan": "s45",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "adon_olam",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "And with my spirit my body.",
      "reference_scan": "s45",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "adon_olam",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "God is with me, I do not fear.",
      "reference_scan": "s45",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "al_netilat_yadayim",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "Blessed art Thou, O Lord our God, King of the World, who has sanctified us through His commandments and commanded us to wash the hands.",
      "reference_scan": "s45",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "asher_yatzar",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "Blessed art Thou, O Lord our God, King of the World, who with wisdom formed man and created in him many openings, many cavities. It is manifest and known before the throne of Thy glory that if one of them were to remain open or one of them to remain closed, it would be impossible to exist and to appear before Thee. Blessed art Thou, O Lord, who heals all flesh and works wonderfully.",
      "reference_scan": "s45",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    }
